OL,3,ADame Esther Rantzen, broadcaster,
OL,4,Acampaigner and charity founder, dies
OL,5,Aaged 86
OL,6,
OL,7,FDame Esther Rantzen has died aged 86
OL,9,FHer family have paid tribute to her as
OL,10,Fthe "most wonderful mother" and a
OL,11,F"cherished grandmother"
OL,13,FDame Esther was known for presenting
OL,14,Fthe BBC TV programme, That's Life, and
OL,15,Flater went on to set up Childline, the
OL,16,Fhelpline for children suffering abuse
OL,17,For neglect
OL,19,FRecently, she had campaigned for the
OL,20,Flegalisation of assisted dying
